@startuml
[*] --> Idle
Idle --> EnteringDetails : Start Planning
EnteringDetails --> Validating : Generate Plan
Validating --> EnteringDetails : Invalid input
Validating --> Analyzing : Valid input
Analyzing --> BlueprintReady : Analysis and SVG complete
BlueprintReady --> Saved : Save project succeeds
BlueprintReady --> BlueprintReady : View / export
Saved --> BlueprintReady : Open saved project
Saved --> [*]
@enduml
